<title>USA: Century Communications names Schneider CFO.</title>
<headline>Century Communications names Schneider CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Century Communications Corp said on Monday it named Scott Schneider chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Schneider currently is senior vice president and treasurer, Century said.  </p>
<p>The company said Schneider is filling the position previously held by Leonard Tow, the company's chairman and chief executive.</p>
